@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@ agent:
           <pr_description>
           {{problem_statement}}
 
-          Before submitting, inspect the final git diff for missing files, accidental changes, syntax errors, and incomplete branches. Add or update a focused regression test when appropriate, run it after the final code edit, and submit only after confirming the working tree contains the complete intended fix.
